'''Tinkaton''' (Japanese: '''デカヌチャン''' ''Dekanuchan'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

