==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Tinkaton|85}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Tinkaton|140}}, one of the {{TCG|SVP Black Star Promos}}.
*{{m|Gigaton Hammer}} is {{p|Tinkaton}}'s [[signature move]] in the [[Pokémon games]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

